<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (As part of my interview as Van Cleef & Arpels, I was tasked with a creative brief on a product that I chose - The Water Lily Bloom Automaton. Placing the lily back in its natural habitat, the automaton sits at the center of a blooming water lily.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (Visitors cross a small bridge one by one; the trickle of water slows them, and the bloom becomes an unexpected pause. It reveals a butterfly matching the room's central pane.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (Light, water and slow movement carry the visitor into a nature larger than the room, the technology hidden behind its hypnotic beauty.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
