<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (To bring a better understanding of the product, I 3D modelled in Blender a full render of the bracelet which I then animated for educational purposes. The goal was to create a demonstration of the product in use as well as put an image to a brand new concept. This model was carefully put into place using various angles from the technical data sheet, and realistically rendered to mimic the real materials used in the bracelet and the different textures these materials created.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
