/P 144 0 R
/E (This is a digital portrait made in Procreate and executed in a style that emphasizes dramatic lighting, vibrant, saturated colors, and textural detail. The rendering suggests techniques found in hyperrealism, yet with an expressive use of color and light that elevates it beyond a mere photographic copy. She wears large, elaborate, cluster-style pearl drop earrings that echo the motif of the small spheres covering her body, unifying the design.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
