/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (This painting was created digitally using Procreate. I carefully picked a colour palette of various values before turning on a black and white filter on my tablet. This allowed me to pick my colours at random, based solely on their values to create a cohesive black and white piece. This process then revealed a fun portrait when I turned off the filter. The painting of this piece was originally meant as a training to work better on my lighting in portraits, but thanks to the colours I chose, turned out to be a colourful portrait that stands out due to its unconventional tones.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
